you can't just cut around the corner and go back to the starting point.

00:18:06.340 --> 00:18:07.960
It won't count as a full lap.

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:12.940
There's plenty of intricacies like that and pits and hills and stuff like that.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:17.280
But I feel like in terms of the actual driving in isometric,

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:21.120
it's actually not as loose or slippery as it could be

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:24.400
knowing what it might be like to drive a car in dirt.

00:18:24.400 --> 00:18:26.680
I feel like that got lost in the translation.

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.660
Yes, it's kind of crazy.

00:18:28.840 --> 00:18:34.000
