00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.640
And when it used the boosts and hits into a wall, like, it spins out.

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:43.000
But I feel like there's no real punishment for going top speed on dirt

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:47.960
and doing, like, a tight turn as there could be in a driving game.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.860
